<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 3COM.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 3COM.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist lowered earnings estimates for 3Com Corp and downgraded it to a buy from a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Cut FY97 Q3 estimate to $0.60/shr from $0.63/shr and trimmed FY97 Q4 to $0.63/shr from $0.67/shr.</p>
<p>-- Cut FY97 estimates to $2.33/shr excluding a charge from $2.40/shr.</p>
<p>-- Expects current qtr will be close to flat.</p>
</text>
